# L §3.1 key K, §5.7 (tally 2.1.6, issue #86): the twin of L3_1_attr_names_move_instance: item names side[2027-03],
# an instance of a move of kind others, not of items, so it is refused LOAD-KEY, as a key not of its kind is.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2027-06-01
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind items: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

kind others: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

kind refunds: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
  attr item: key items

place acct: accounts PLN lives 2027-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2027-01-01..

input bank: observed

input amt: money PLN

move get[m in months]: items
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to acct amount amt

move side[m in months]: others
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to acct amount amt

ask t: count(f in refunds over .. where f.item == r) for r in items over 2027-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "the plan"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2027-03-10, kind: refunds, leg cash from acct to world amount 10.00 PLN, item: side[2027-03]) "line 1"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY side[2027-03] is not a key of items (m.tally:44)
